{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:033L:statement", "parent_tag": "033H", "chapter": "properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be an integral scheme.\nThen <MATH_0002> is normal if and only if for every nonempty affine open\n<MATH_0003> the ring <MATH_0004> is a normal domain.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$X$", "MATH_0003": "$U \\subset X$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{O}_X(U)$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-integral-normal}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:91f1c60948fd1ff48958dd49efe124c6da0ba8dc8920914f6086deb42326f1f2", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:6157509903b530f010f130687a03db033a2d82aec0a61bb0e94479616c63468a", "source_math_hash": "sha256:de5db278aeee69930d7d348e3dcab9764e6ae00a308daf6a9bd7a37b340046be"}
